WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:12.530
Sup dawg? This week on Thug Notes
we gettin ALL old school with A Separate Peace

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.430
by John Knowles.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.620
When Gene Forrester returns to
Devon- the prep school trap he was at fifteen

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.779
years ago, he starts thinkin’ bout da sh**
that went down when he was a lil shawty.

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:30.849
When Gene was 16, he was always
chillin with main boy Finny, who was also

00:00:30.849 --> 00:00:36.440
his roommate. Gene all brains and no balls.
And dat boy Finny be a throwed-up athlete

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:41.360
who lives life on da edge. But even though
these fools ain’t flowin the same rhyme,

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.390
they BRO DEEP.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.400
During the summer of 1942, Gene and
Finny start a lil’ gang of they own. And

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.370
if you wanna roll with their crew, you gotta
flex yo’ nuts by jumpin’ off a big ass

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.330
tree.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:57.540
Gene starts to get mad jealous bout
Finny bein high baller and beatin the rap

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:02.210
erry time he find trouble. So one day when
they roll up to dat tree, Gene straight playa

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:08.270
hates and shakes Finny off, fu**in his leg
UP. But lucky for Gene, it seems that erryone

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:11.210
think it an accident so he dodges all da heat.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:15.280
Gene eventually gets so torn up
over the guilt that he swangs ova to Finny’s

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:19.680
crib to lay down da truth. But Finny ain’t
hearin dat mess and don’t believe a damn

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.740
word he say.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:25.210
Since America decided to get off
its lazy ass and join World War II, some smooth

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:30.560
talkin white boy named Brinker try to get
Gene to strap up and glock some Germans. At

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.460
first Gene and Brinker all bout joinin the
cause, but sh** gets too real and they both

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.570
bitch out.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.549
Later, Brinker gathers errybody to
snitch on Gene for wrecking Finny’s leg.

00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:45.750
But when Finny hears people say Gene did it
on purpose, he rollsout of there REAL quick.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.090
He haulin such ass that he falls down some
stairs and breaks his leg AGAIN. Even though

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.170
it ain’t as broke as the first time, he
still gonna need an operation.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:55.670
Gene finally nuts-up and heads over
to the doc where he fesses up to Finny. Even

00:01:55.670 --> 00:02:00.869
though Finny-boy got beef at first, he eventually
lets it slide and they cool again. But what

00:02:00.869 --> 00:02:06.580
was s’posed to be a no-hassles procedure
turns out ALL fu**ed up and Finny’s heart

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.560
stops. Fool dead.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.230
After seein his boy get put in
dirt, Gene is able to bury something else

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:18.300
too- his anger.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:22.910
Listen good, playboy. Knowles layin
down all sorts of thematic real talk on our

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.060
asses by slangin what some literary crews
call “the double.”

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:31.140
You can peep doubling all up in the characters.
See, Finny’s perky self

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:36.860
always geeked up trying to enjoy the world
in childs play- or paidia in ancient Greek.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:42.180
Whereas Gene always so damn serious
and sees people not as bruthas to party wit,

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.750
but as rivals. Fool always lookin for a struggle-
or Agon.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.640
Knowles gone and even doubled up
the setting. Devon lay smack in the middle

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:56.440
of two rivers. The Devon river all clear and
pure. The Naguamsett, though, be so nasty,

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:01.390
it’s as if someone took a big ol’ sh**
in it. All this symbolizing how Gene, Finny,

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:06.430
and all dem other little thugz gotta choose
between love and hate.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:10.030
But even though part of it’s a
choice, another part is gonna make its way

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:14.620
in to yo’ life no matter what. Finny always
spinning tales to make the world seem like

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:18.060
it ain’t such a crooked place. But when
he’s forced to face the truth that Gene

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:22.520
did him straight dirty, his heart just can’t
keep hackin it- and all dat symbolized by

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.459
the marrow makin its way to his heart.

00:03:24.459 --> 00:03:28.770
Now how bout we get all biblical up
in this piece?! Just like Adam got his ass

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:33.670
tossed out out after swipin dat apple, Gene
wrecks his own innocence by back-stabbin Finny.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:38.810
And cuz o’ dat, Gene gets isolated from
erryone on tha block- even himself.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:42.200
And that ain’t the only way the
apple don’t fall far from the tree. Gene

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:46.349
also learns what’s up from dat forbidden
fruit of crossin his main man.

00:03:46.349 --> 00:03:50.810
Cuz after Finny takes his long dirt nap, Gene
finally learns who he is,

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:55.260
how to stop bein a jealous hater, and a lil
somethin about the whack- ass nature of the

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:56.290
human heart.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:04:00.760
He realize that all dat beefin and
warrin that humans do on the reg ain’t nothin

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.409
but ignorance.

00:04:01.409 --> 00:04:04.849
Yo thanks for watchin’ Thug Notes
and don’t forget to check out my store if

00:04:04.849 --> 00:04:11.849
you wanna roll like a real literary OG. Peace!

